#: src117/port/data/port_install_window.cpp:94
msgid "Choose the StarCraft folder itself, the one that holds StarCraft Launcher.exe and the x86_64 and Data folders, for example drive_c/Program Files (x86)/StarCraft in the Wine or Lutris prefix Battle.net is installed in."
